# SECURITY (Agent #14)
# GEMINI_API_KEY IS NO LONGER USED BY THE CLIENT and must not be provided.
# Model traffic is authorized by Firebase App Check (Play Integrity in release).
# Keep the key server-side only.
#
# The one secret this file may carry is the App Check debug token for local builds:
# FIREBASE_APPCHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN=your-debug-token
